g  products that go into  hydrogen we also manufacture products  that go into into wind energy as  uh as well yeah and then a few years ago  those didn't exist but we've invested in  those but we've invested in those  because we felt it was the right thing  to do  but what we're looking for is incentives  investment from the government in order  for other people to follow suit as well  the debate over the coal mine has given  cumbria a moment in the sun  how to phase out fossil fuels of the  past to meet climate ambitions of the  future  lisa holland sky
 

